{
  "name": "decks_make",
  "description": "Make a presentation deck from one sentence in Deck maker (Decks app). prompt is the sentence (what the deck is for, who it is for); optional notes, card_count (4 to 16, default 8), density (concise, balanced, detailed), theme (Paper, Graphite, Harbor, Clay) or look 'brand' for the Lemma's brand. Writes the outline only: the person approves it in Decks, then the cards are written. Returns the deck's path in the decks app.",
